### Critical Numbers

| What | Value |
|------|-------|
| Text contrast (AA) | 4.5:1 |
| Large text contrast (AA) | 3:1 |
| Body font size | ≥16px |
| Line height | 1.4–1.6 |
| Line length | 45–75 characters |
| Touch target | ≥44×44px |
| Base spacing unit | 4px or 8px |
| Nav items | 5–7 max |
| Enter animation | 200–300ms |
| Exit animation | 150–200ms |

